                                "type": "TextualBody",
                                "format": "text/html",
                                "value": "<p>[fol. 835r]</p><p>Die Veneris 21 decembris 1629</p><p></p><p>Fuit facta congregatio in Academia in solita Mansione<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>sup<em>r</em>a Ecc<em>le</em>sia<em>e</em> S<em>anc</em>ti Luca<em>e</em> in Campo Boario Pictorum<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Sculptorum, et Recamator<em>um</em> Urbis in qua de ord<em>i</em>ne<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>ut ass<em>eru</em>it Ill.mi et R.mi D Car<em>dinal</em>is Barberini Protectoris in<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>inter omnes […]<sup>[1]</sup> Intervenit Ill.m D Eques<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Pictoru<em>m</em> et Intervener<em>un</em>t infra<em>s</em>c<em>rip</em>ti d<em>icte</em> Academia<em>e</em> V<em>idelicet</em><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Cavaliero Giuseppe Cesari Prencipe del Accademia<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Cav.ro Baglione pr<em>im</em>o Consigliero<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Cav.ro Octavio Leone Secondo Consigliero<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Cav.ro Lorenzo Bernini<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Pier Fran.co de Rossi Camerlengho<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Mich'Angelo Guidi Proveditore<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Prospero Orsi<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Mattheo Pagani<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Thomasso Baglioni<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Gio Ant'o Carosio<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Silvio Capi<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Gio Bat'ta Luti<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Bartholomeo Bombelli<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Gio Bat'ta<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Il S.r Claudio Savà</p><p></p><p>[1]&nbsp;Unclear.</p>"
                            }
